OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 30s and a man in his
OL,7,F40s, who were in a car suspected of
OL,8,Fcrashing into the Stagecoach
OL,9,Fsingle-decker bus prior to it hitting
OL,10,Fthe house, have been arrested.
